nl-ease (1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add single-instance locking for daemon mode.
  * Fix schedule window edge case when start hour equals end hour.
  * Make 12h/24h AM-PM detection robust against fast drags and
    multi-step spinner jumps.
  * Move config, pid and lock files into a dedicated
    ~/.config/nl-ease/ subfolder.
  * Fix save button spacing and stale AM/PM label rendering on
    format switch.
  * Delay GUI exit until the daemon force-kill safety timer runs.
  * Localization update.

