nl-ease (1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Add configurable 12h/24h time format to the GUI.
  * Fix daemon reload logic to avoid stale state and display flicker.
  * Localization.
  * Temperature slider shows numerical value.
  * Handle SIGTERM/SIGHUP cleanly in the daemon.

